# Build context = repo root (see Dockerfile). Keep it small and never ship host
# build outputs, caches, the venv, or secrets — stage 1 rebuilds frontend/dist.
**/node_modules
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
.git
.github
graphify-out
frontend/dist
**/.DS_Store
**/client_secret*.json
**/*.db
